[I] Simple program to inhibit sleep/suspend when using elogind

[T] sleep-inhibitor is a simple Python program that inhibits sleep and
[T] suspend on systemd or elogind based Linux systems while certain
[T] conditions apply. Its plugins, for example, inhibit sleep while audio is
[T] playing or while media servers such as Plex are streaming.

[U] https://github.com/bulletmark/sleep-inhibitor

[A] Sleep-inhibitor Authors
